{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35712","headline":"短歌行 · 李咸用","name":"短歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一罇绿酒绿於染，拍手高歌天地险。\n上得青云下不难，下在黄埃上须渐。\n少年欢乐须及时，莫学懦夫长泣岐。\n白日欲沈犹未沈，片月已来天半垂。\n坎鼓锵钟杀愁贼，挼碎是非佯不识。\n长短高卑不可求，莫叹人生头雪色。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}